{
  "$comment": "The url-text plain encoding (Telo.Url), pinned for every runtime: each runtime's codec reads every 'decode' text to the members it lists, or refuses it with exactly the reason given, and writes those members as 'canonical'; and builds every 'compose' object of members into the value whose canonical text is given, or refuses it with exactly the reason given. A port is written as a JSON number; a member that is absent is absent. A reason never quotes a value, since a URL routinely carries a password.",
